\chapter{Abstract}
The objective of this project is to design and implement a 4:1 multiplexer using CMOS transmission gates in Cadence Virtuoso with the GPDK 90nm technology library. The design was verified using the Spectre simulator under transient analysis. The output waveform confirms that the circuit correctly selects one of four input signals based on two select lines, demonstrating correct logical operation and low-power CMOS behavior.

